  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-素材与创意\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"用户可以通过此接口上传和营销相关的音频图片，例如图文中的音频。可使用上传后获得的音频id去「上传图文」接口创建图文素材（图文素材为白名单功能，如需使用请联系销售或运营同学）。\",\"id\":\"marketing.audio.upload\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/file/audio/ad/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1780005237921792\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"marketing.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"marketing.graphic.upload\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"可使用此接口上传后获得的音频id去调用该接口创建图文素材\",\"relation\":\"后置接口\",\"title\":\"上传图文\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1780005237921792\",\"title\":\"上传图文内的音频素材\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-DmY1Fg5M\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-A8bB3iU0\">通过此接口，用户可以上传和营销相关的音频图片，例如图文中的音频。</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201779446011373640%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-09T7U3je\" id=\"h346b9f0-09T7U3je\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ta9dBLHH\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/file/audio/ad/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/file/audio/ad/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1780005237921792\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-VBNIb56T\" id=\"h346b9f0-VBNIb56T\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-eBRREDoG\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Q760VZAc\" id=\"h346b9f0-Q760VZAc\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hk3rWG6E\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fc9mqTVe\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>multipart/form-data</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-nOi1Sh38\" id=\"h346b9f0-nOi1Sh38\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-a2ZZFVQE\">客户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">upload_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-tgu3B6u5\">音频上传方式 ，允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-I8FMmhfF\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-fE2TO2Q0\"><code>UPLOAD_BY_FILE</code> 文件上传（默认值）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QIZB5ME5\"><code>UPLOAD_BY_URL</code> 网址上传</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">audio_signature</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-13NzMkFT\">音频的md5值(用于服务端校验)\n</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-qX9p54YY\">upload_type为UPLOAD_BY_FILE时必填</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">audio_file</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>file</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fu4AVpLR\">音频文件，upload_type为UPLOAD_BY_FILE时必填</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-5plOvbHr\">允许格式：m4a、mp3</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-0N4Lbrwp\">文件大小：≤20M</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">audio_url</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Mp1xXr8Y\">音频url地址，如<a href=\"http://xxx.xxx\" target=\"_blank\">http://xxx.xxx</a>，upload_type为UPLOAD_BY_URL必填</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Wi3PDQl8\" id=\"h346b9f0-Wi3PDQl8\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2F2%2Ffile%2Faudio%2Fad%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20post(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20POST%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%